                        "content": "$P(D|+) = \\dfrac{P(+|D)P(D)}{P(+|D)P(D)+P(+|\\overline{D})P(\\overline{D})} = \\dfrac{0.95 \\times 0.01}{0.95\\times0.01 + 0.10\\times0.99} = \\dfrac{0.0095}{0.1085} \\approx 8.7\\%$."
