            "topic": "System Dynamics",
            "title": "Second-Order Damping Ratio",
            "question": "A massive mechanical mass-spring-damper system is mathematically a 'second-order' system. If the system's calculated Damping Ratio ($\\zeta$) is exactly $1.0$, the physical system is strictly classified as:",
