            "title": "Radius of Gyration",
            "question": "The geometric 'Radius of Gyration' ($k$) of a steel column is a critical mathematical property used to predict if the column will physically buckle and collapse under heavy weight. It is mathematically calculated by:",
            "question_image": "",
