                        "content": "$h_1 = 250$ kJ/kg (Evaporator exit), $h_2 = 285$ kJ/kg (Compressor exit), $h_3 = 100$ kJ/kg (Condenser exit). For an ideal cycle, $h_4 = h_3 = 100$ kJ/kg."
