            "title": "Space Mean Speed vs Time Mean Speed",
            "question": "In traffic engineering, if a police officer stands next to a highway and uses a radar gun to record the speeds of 100 passing cars, the simple mathematical average of those 100 speeds is formally defined as the:",
            "question_image": "",
