            "question": "A normally consolidated clay layer has thickness H = 4 m, initial void ratio e0 = 0.90, Cc = 0.35. The initial effective overburden stress σ'v0 = 80 kPa and stress increase Δσ = 40 kPa. What is the primary consolidation settlement Sc?",
