                        "title": "Consolidation Settlement Formula",
                        "content": "$S_c = \\frac{C_c H}{1+e_0} \\log\\left(\\frac{\\sigma'_{v0}+\\Delta\\sigma}{\\sigma'_{v0}}\\right) = \\frac{0.35 \\times 4000}{1+0.90} \\log\\left(\\frac{80+40}{80}\\right)$"
