                        "content": "$\\frac{t_{single}}{t_{double}} = \\left(\\frac{H_{dr,single}}{H_{dr,double}}\\right)^2 = \\left(\\frac{6}{3}\\right)^2 = 4$. So $t_{single} = 4 \\times 2 = 8$ years."
