                    {
                        "title": "Compute Intermediate Terms",
                        "content": "$h_2^2 - h_1^2 = 3364 - 3025 = 339$. Also, $\\ln(4) = 1.386$."
                    },
                    {
                        "title": "Calculate Pumping Rate",
                        "content": "$Q = \\frac{\\pi \\times 40 \\times 339}{1.386} = \\frac{42,600}{1.386} = 30,736 \\text{ ft}^3\\text{/day}$. The closest approximation is 30,700."
                    }
