            "question": "Three monitoring wells (A, B, C) form an equilateral triangle with 500-foot sides. The measured groundwater elevations are 105 ft at A, 105 ft at B, and 100 ft at C. What is the magnitude of the hydraulic gradient? (Assume C is positioned perfectly perpendicular to the line connecting A and B).",
