            "title": "Manning's Equation for Open Channel Flow",
            "question": "A rectangular concrete channel (Manning's n = 0.013) is 10 ft wide and carries water at a depth of 5 ft. The channel bottom slope is 0.001. What is the approximate flow rate?",
            "question_image": "",
