            "title": "Infiltration (Horton's Equation)",
            "question": "The initial infiltration capacity of a soil is 2.5 in/hr, and its final constant infiltration capacity is 0.5 in/hr. The decay constant is $0.4 \\text{ hr}^{-1}$. What is the infiltration capacity after 3 hours?",
