            "content": "A timber beam bears on a wall plate over a length of 4 in. The beam is 4 in wide, and the reaction is 3,600 lb. If F'c⊥ = 625 psi, is the bearing adequate?",
            "question": "A 4-in wide timber beam has a 3,600 lb reaction over a 4-in bearing length on a plate. F'c⊥ = 625 psi. The actual bearing stress fc⊥ is:",
