                        "content": "Bearing area = 4 in × 4 in = 16 in². $f_{c\\perp} = \\frac{P}{A_b} = \\frac{3600}{16} = 225$ psi. Since 225 psi < F'c⊥ = 625 psi, the bearing is adequate."
