            "content": "Three beams meeting at a joint have stiffness values $k_1=4EI/L_1$, $k_2=4EI/L_2$, $k_3=3EI/L_3$. What does the distribution factor for member 1 equal?",
            "question": "Three beams meeting at a joint have stiffness values $k_1$, $k_2$, $k_3$. What is the distribution factor for member 1?",
