            "topic": "Traverse Surveying",
            "title": "Angular Closure",
            "question": "When a surveyor completes a closed-loop interior angle traverse with '$n$' total sides (and thus '$n$' internal angles), the mathematical sum of all measured interior angles must theoretically equal exactly:",
