            "title": "Routh-Hurwitz Stability Sizing",
            "question": "A system has a characteristic equation given by $q(s) = s^3 + 2s^2 + 4s + K = 0$. Determine the range of the feedback gain $K$ for which the system is steady-state stable.",
            "question_image": "",
