            "title": "Second-Order System Damping Ratio Sizing",
            "question": "A second-order control system has a characteristic equation $s^2 + 8s + 25 = 0$. Calculate the natural frequency ($\\omega_n$) and damping ratio ($\\zeta$).",
            "question_image": "",
