                        "title": "Apply Theorem",
                        "content": "$y(0^+) = \\lim_{s \\to \\infty} s \\left( \\frac{2s+5}{s^2+3s+2} \\right) = \\lim_{s \\to \\infty} \\frac{2s^2+5s}{s^2+3s+2}$."
