            "question": "A catalyst pore has a circular cross-section with an average pore radius of $r = 5\\text{ nm}$ ($5 \\times 10^{-9}\\text{ m}$). If helium at 373 K is diffusing through this pore, estimate the Knudsen diffusion coefficient ($D_{KA}$). (Molecular weight of He = 4 g/mol).",
            "question_image": "",
