                        "title": "Identify Knudsen Diffusivity Equation",
                        "content": "$D_{KA} = 97.0 r \\sqrt{\\frac{T}{M}}$, where $r$ is pore radius in meters, $T$ is temperature in Kelvin, and $M$ is molecular weight in g/mol."
