            "question": "A liquid mixture contains 30 mol% benzene (A) and 70 mol% toluene (B) at boiling point. If the relative volatility of benzene to toluene is $\\alpha_{AB} = 2.5$, calculate the mole fraction of benzene in the vapor phase ($y_A$) in equilibrium with this liquid.",
