            "question": "A batch extraction uses a volume of solvent ($V_S$) to extract solute from a feed volume ($V_F$) with distribution coefficient $K$. To maximize the total amount of solute extracted using a fixed total volume of solvent $V_{total}$, which of the following is most effective?",
