            "question": "A gas absorption process has film mass transfer coefficients of $k_y = 1.5\\text{ mol}/(\\text{m}^2\\cdot\\text{s}\\cdot\\text{mol frac})$ and $k_x = 20.0\\text{ mol}/(\\text{m}^2\\cdot\\text{s}\\cdot\\text{mol frac})$. The equilibrium relationship is $y^* = 2.0 x$. Calculate the overall gas-phase mass transfer coefficient ($K_y$).",
