            "question": "A gas adsorption data follows the Langmuir isotherm: $q = \\frac{q_m K P}{1 + K P}$. At a partial pressure of $P = 10\\text{ kPa}$, the amount adsorbed is $q = 2.0\\text{ mmol/g}$. If the maximum monolayer capacity is $q_m = 5.0\\text{ mmol/g}$, calculate the adsorption equilibrium constant ($K$).",
