            "question": "A spherical quartz particle (density $2650\\text{ kg/m}^3$, diameter $50\\text{ \\mu m}$) falls through water (density $1000\\text{ kg/m}^3$, viscosity $1.0 \\times 10^{-3}\\text{ Pa}\\cdot\\text{s}$). Calculate the terminal settling velocity ($v_t$) of this particle using Stokes' Law.",
            "question_image": "",
