            "title": "Reference Dose (RfD)",
            "question": "A chemical has an RfD of $0.003\\ \\text{mg/kg·day}$. A person weighing $70\\ \\text{kg}$ is exposed to $0.1\\ \\text{mg/day}$. What is the Hazard Quotient (HQ)?",
