                        "content": "$q = K H \\dfrac{N_f}{N_d} = (2 \\times 10^{-5} \\text{ m/s}) \\times 6.0 \\text{ m} \\times \\dfrac{4}{12} = 1.2 \\times 10^{-4} \\times 0.333 = 4.0 \\times 10^{-5}$ m³/s per meter width."
